1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,496
My best mate's a werewolf.

2
00:00:02,546 --> 00:00:03,735
So am I.

3
00:00:03,885 --> 00:00:06,116
And he's just let himself in.

4
00:00:06,346 --> 00:00:07,036
Last week,

5
00:00:07,086 --> 00:00:09,211
I found out he took his uncle's arm.

6
00:00:09,261 --> 00:00:11,140
And told me I did it.

7
00:00:11,449 --> 00:00:12,604
He didn't come at me.

8
00:00:12,654 --> 00:00:13,989
He sat down.

9
00:00:14,059 --> 00:00:14,604
He said,

10
00:00:14,654 --> 00:00:16,578
it's a full moon in an hour.

11
00:00:16,628 --> 00:00:18,777
And Mick's not here to watch us.

12
00:00:19,007 --> 00:00:21,561
Then he slid something across the table.

13
00:00:21,611 --> 00:00:22,998
A silver nail.

14
00:00:23,388 --> 00:00:25,698
Mick put one in every windowsill on this street,

15
00:00:25,748 --> 00:00:26,373
he said.

16
00:00:26,423 --> 00:00:27,760
Go and look.

17
00:00:28,150 --> 00:00:29,005
Number two.

18
00:00:29,055 --> 00:00:29,970
Silver.

19
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:30,890
Number four.

20
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:31,851
Silver.

21
00:00:31,901 --> 00:00:33,166
Even Danny's house.

22
00:00:33,216 --> 00:00:34,156
Silver.

23
00:00:34,306 --> 00:00:35,776
His mum was at the window.

24
00:00:35,826 --> 00:00:37,430
Watching me count.

25
00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:39,879
Every house on Moor End.

26
00:00:40,109 --> 00:00:41,307
Except one.

27
00:00:42,017 --> 00:00:42,944
Mick's.

28
00:00:43,494 --> 00:00:45,129
Eight little holes in the wood.

29
00:00:45,179 --> 00:00:45,844
Fresh.

30
00:00:45,894 --> 00:00:47,289
Still splintered.

31
00:00:47,958 --> 00:00:49,946
Danny hadn't come to warn me.

32
00:00:50,056 --> 00:00:51,913
He'd come to pull them out.

33
00:00:54,863 --> 00:00:55,951
Come out.
